WEBVTT

00:02.020 --> 00:05.220
It's the grand finals of the National Youth Football Tournament.

00:05.220 --> 00:08.850
Oddly enough, we have ended up with the same pairing as the very first match.

00:09.580 --> 00:11.650
The final match begins!

00:17.070 --> 00:19.650
Hyuga rushes forward in Nankatsu's side.

00:19.650 --> 00:22.580
Tsubasa! I'll settle the score with my football today!

00:23.070 --> 00:25.230
Bring it on, Kojiro Hyuga!

00:25.230 --> 00:28.040
Tsubasa Ozora, the captain, goes to engage!

00:28.040 --> 00:29.500
Is it already time for a clash?!

00:29.500 --> 00:33.050
How do you like... this?!

00:33.050 --> 00:34.980
Hyuga unleashes a powerful shot!

00:34.980 --> 00:36.970
The ball slams into Tsubasa's stomach!

00:51.070 --> 00:56.680
<i>The smell of the grass when I stumbled,</i>

00:51.070 --> 00:56.680
<i>koronda toki no shibafu no nioi</i>

00:56.680 --> 01:01.730
<i>the endless blue of the sky above...</i>

00:56.680 --> 01:01.730
<i>aogimita sora no ao hateshinakatta</i>

01:02.400 --> 01:07.530
<i>This winding, back-and-forth path</i>

01:02.400 --> 01:07.530
<i>mayotte modori susumu kidô ga</i>

01:08.280 --> 01:15.870
<i>is a map for our endless dreams</i>

01:08.280 --> 01:15.870
<i>hateshinai yume o miru boku-tachi no chizu</i>

01:15.870 --> 01:21.640
<i>Even if my hopes miss the goal</i>

01:15.870 --> 01:21.640
<i>goal o soreta kibô ga atte mo</i>

01:21.640 --> 01:30.140
<i>if I stand back up, my dreams will never end</i>

01:21.640 --> 01:30.140
<i>mata tachiagaru nara yume wa owaranai</i>

01:30.140 --> 01:35.930
<i>No.1! Race forth, faster than anyone</i>

01:30.140 --> 01:35.930
<i>No. 1! dare yori hayaku kakenuke</i>

01:35.930 --> 01:41.860
<i>Make a starting dash toward the world stage with your tricky plays!</i>

01:35.930 --> 01:41.860
<i>tricky na play de sekai e muke Start! Dash!</i>

01:41.860 --> 01:43.400
<i>Run & Run!</i>

01:43.400 --> 01:50.690
<i>Aspirations are the one buzz, buzz, buzz that gets us moving</i>

01:43.400 --> 01:50.690
<i>akogare dake ga boku-ra o chiri-chiri-chiri ugokasu yo
</i>

01:50.690 --> 01:53.610
<i>Blaze, blaze, blaze! Let's go, it's kickoff!</i>

01:50.690 --> 01:53.610
<i>mera-mera-mera iku ze kickoff</i>

01:53.610 --> 01:58.540
<i>Leap out into a giant field of dreams</i>

01:53.610 --> 01:58.540
<i>tobidasô dodekai dream field</i>

02:09.270 --> 02:13.310
<b><b>EPISODE 23:
PRODIGY KEEPER RETURNS!</b></b>

02:11.650 --> 02:12.520
Tsubasa!

02:12.520 --> 02:13.520
That bastard!

02:13.520 --> 02:15.020
He hit him on purpose!

02:19.400 --> 02:20.110
What?!

02:20.610 --> 02:22.740
The ball is sent to Misaki.

02:22.740 --> 02:25.810
The winner isn't going to be you, Hyuga...

02:25.810 --> 02:26.990
It's going to be me!

02:27.820 --> 02:28.990
This guy...!

02:28.990 --> 02:30.830
It's just as he says, Kojiro.

02:30.830 --> 02:32.170
Misaki...

02:32.170 --> 02:35.700
I may have played alongside you
while I was in Meiwa Elementary.

02:35.700 --> 02:39.440
But now, I'm a player at Nankatsu SC,
and I'm your opponent!

02:39.440 --> 02:44.850
I'll definitely hold that championship
pennant in my hands with Tsubasa!

02:44.850 --> 02:45.470
What?!

02:45.470 --> 02:48.220
It's a long pass meant for Tsubasa!

02:49.070 --> 02:50.560
Nice, Misaki!

02:50.560 --> 02:53.100
As expected of Nankatsu's Golden Duo!

02:53.100 --> 02:55.780
Tsubasa directly aims for the goal.

02:55.780 --> 02:58.110
It flies right towards the corner of the goal!

02:58.680 --> 03:00.590
H-he got it!

03:00.590 --> 03:01.360
What?!

03:02.530 --> 03:05.580
He follows through with a forward somersault!

03:05.580 --> 03:06.960
That's a perfect landing!

03:06.960 --> 03:09.430
A stunning save by the goalkeeper Wakashimazu!

03:09.430 --> 03:10.870
Nice, Wakashimazu!

03:10.870 --> 03:13.040
Well done, Wakashimazu!

03:13.040 --> 03:15.780
His performance against Furano was clearly no fluke!

03:15.780 --> 03:19.800
Wakashimazu is a skilled goalkeeper, indeed!

03:19.800 --> 03:22.330
I'm sorry, but as long as I'm here,

03:22.330 --> 03:26.140
I won't let you score a single time this match.

03:26.140 --> 03:26.970
What...?!

03:26.970 --> 03:29.560
Victory will be Meiwa's!

03:30.140 --> 03:32.690
Is it time for Meiwa's attack?

03:32.690 --> 03:34.350
I'll get this in one go.

03:34.350 --> 03:35.650
Pass me the ball!

03:35.650 --> 03:36.520
Yes!

03:36.520 --> 03:38.020
Let's get the first goal...

03:38.020 --> 03:39.250
And who said you could?!

03:39.250 --> 03:39.860
What?!

03:39.860 --> 03:42.280
Ishizaki forcibly intercepts the ball!

03:42.280 --> 03:43.400
I got it!

03:43.400 --> 03:45.720
That was great, Ishizaki! Keep that up!

03:45.720 --> 03:47.240
Take this, Taki!

03:47.240 --> 03:48.340
Got it!

03:48.340 --> 03:50.920
He quickly passes the ball to Taki on the right side!

03:50.920 --> 03:52.360
Nankatsu attacks once again!

03:52.360 --> 03:54.250
They're relentless!

03:54.250 --> 03:56.920
Stop him! Don't let him cross!

03:57.980 --> 04:01.300
Meiwa uses a two-man sliding tackle to steal the ball!

04:03.200 --> 04:05.430
However, Misaki recovers the ball!

04:06.190 --> 04:07.970
Today, I definitely won't lose!

04:07.970 --> 04:11.070
Tsubasa is running in front of the goal.

04:11.070 --> 04:11.770
Mark him!

04:11.770 --> 04:15.270
Nankatsu is once again planning
on scoring with their Golden Duo!

04:15.270 --> 04:16.900
Here comes the cross!

04:18.650 --> 04:21.570
It looks like Tsubasa was just a bait!

04:22.030 --> 04:22.780
I've got it!

04:24.060 --> 04:24.920
What?!

04:24.920 --> 04:28.620
The keeper, Wakashimazu, catches the ball!

04:29.660 --> 04:31.870
Another nice save from him!

04:31.870 --> 04:32.320
Damn it!

04:32.320 --> 04:34.470
While the defenders were lured by Tsubasa,

04:34.470 --> 04:38.920
Wakashimazu was the only one who was able to calmly read into their strategy.

04:38.920 --> 04:41.670
This goalkeeper is the real deal.

04:41.670 --> 04:45.170
Not just his ability to save, but his judgment is excellent, too.

04:45.170 --> 04:48.760
I guess this makes me the third best goalkeeper...

04:48.760 --> 04:51.060
It's no wonder he was able to stop my penalty kick...

04:51.560 --> 04:53.560
This is as far as Nankatsu will get!

04:53.560 --> 04:56.500
Let's do this, captain!

04:58.990 --> 05:00.730
Nice pass, Wakashimazu!

05:00.730 --> 05:03.480
All right! If Hyuga's on it, we're sure to score!

05:03.480 --> 05:06.440
Stop him! Don't let him get through!

05:06.440 --> 05:08.290
Let's go, Nankatsu!

05:08.290 --> 05:09.910
Stop me if you can!

05:09.910 --> 05:12.370
I'll show you the full extent of my skills!

05:12.370 --> 05:16.120
Nankatsu tries to stop him with two players!

05:16.120 --> 05:17.570
These bastards...

05:20.000 --> 05:23.060
Hyuga forcefully breaks through!

05:23.060 --> 05:27.170
This is Hyuga's power! His lust for victory!

05:27.170 --> 05:28.340
Takeshi!

05:28.340 --> 05:31.760
Hyuga passes the ball to Sawada and starts running to the goal.

05:32.430 --> 05:38.080
If Nankatsu has Tsubasa and Misaki,
Meiwa has Hyuga and Sawada.

05:38.080 --> 05:38.940
Hyuga!

05:38.940 --> 05:40.120
All right!

05:40.120 --> 05:41.060
Damn it!

05:41.060 --> 05:43.400
The pass reaches Hyuga in front of the goal!

05:43.400 --> 05:46.080
Eat this, Nankatsu!

05:47.760 --> 05:48.780
What?!

05:48.780 --> 05:49.870
He's stopped!

05:49.870 --> 05:52.910
The keeper, Wakabayashi, hangs on to the ball!

05:55.330 --> 05:58.270
That's Wakabayashi for you!

05:58.270 --> 06:03.630
That's right. If Meiwa has Wakashimazu,
then Nankatsu has Wakabayashi!

06:03.630 --> 06:07.470
People expect a great deal from
Genzo Wakabayashi in the future,

06:07.470 --> 06:10.760
having already shown his skills at the national level.

06:10.760 --> 06:14.220
That was a perfect jump and a perfect save!

06:12.240 --> 06:14.220
That was great, Wakabayashi!

06:14.220 --> 06:18.230
Genzo Wakabayashi blew our captain off, just like that...

06:18.230 --> 06:22.890
Hyuga, I came here to pay you back.

06:22.890 --> 06:24.730
I definitely won't lose to you!

06:24.730 --> 06:27.510
Damn it! Just watch me, Wakabayashi!

06:27.510 --> 06:30.110
I'll definitely steal a goal from you!

06:30.110 --> 06:32.410
Go and get that first goal, guys!

06:32.410 --> 06:35.620
Both keepers are pretty good, aren't they?

06:35.620 --> 06:39.580
Neither Hyuga nor Tsubasa will be easily scoring today.

06:39.580 --> 06:41.020
I couldn't have asked for more.

06:41.020 --> 06:41.790
What?!

06:41.790 --> 06:46.760
The striker of Toho Academy can't be less than a genuine ace striker

06:46.760 --> 06:49.880
who is able to score, even against the best goalkeepers.

06:49.880 --> 06:51.400
Tsubasa!

06:52.430 --> 06:53.800
Like we'd let you!

06:54.840 --> 06:56.510
Tsubasa slips by with feints!

06:56.510 --> 06:59.520
He quickly accelerates and dashes towards Meiwa's goal.

06:59.520 --> 07:01.580
Think hard, Tsubasa!

07:01.580 --> 07:04.910
You won't get past that keeper simply by kicking the ball.

07:04.910 --> 07:07.180
In football, you must use your imagination.

07:07.180 --> 07:11.280
Everything and everyone on the field
can be used to your advantage.

07:11.280 --> 07:13.530
I'll score the first goal—this time, for sure!

07:15.280 --> 07:17.870
Tsubasa gets in position to shoot.

07:17.870 --> 07:20.040
What kind of shot will it be?

07:20.040 --> 07:22.210
All right, I don't care where you shoot from!

07:23.550 --> 07:25.700
Wait, he misses the ball!

07:25.700 --> 07:26.250
What?!

07:27.750 --> 07:29.740
No, it was on purpose!

07:29.740 --> 07:33.940
Wakashimazu is tricked by Tsubasa's feint
and loses his balance!

07:33.940 --> 07:34.840
Crap!

07:34.840 --> 07:36.010
Wakashimazu...!

07:37.260 --> 07:39.430
Misaki shoots!

07:40.560 --> 07:41.400
What?!

07:41.400 --> 07:45.270
Despite being off balance,
Wakashimazu deflects the ball with his foot!

07:45.270 --> 07:47.060
Nice, Wakashimazu!

07:47.600 --> 07:49.480
Meiwa doesn't follow the ball!

07:49.480 --> 07:52.740
It goes to the crossing specialist, Taki!

07:52.740 --> 07:53.570
Great!

07:53.570 --> 07:54.610
All you, Tsubasa!

07:54.610 --> 07:55.910
This time, for sure!

07:57.870 --> 08:00.240
A direct shot from Tsubasa!

08:00.950 --> 08:02.710
H-he got it!

08:02.710 --> 08:04.710
How the...? {DOSTEDT lol}

08:04.710 --> 08:05.460
Wakashimazu!

08:07.000 --> 08:09.340
That was a breathtakingly nice move!

08:09.340 --> 08:10.620
He did it!

08:10.620 --> 08:13.340
He jumped off the goal post in the opposite direction,

08:13.340 --> 08:15.220
and made a ridiculous catch.

08:15.840 --> 08:18.620
His play has left everyone standing in awe!

08:19.460 --> 08:21.140
That's Wakashimazu for you.

08:21.140 --> 08:24.780
The blood of generations of karate
practitioners flows in his veins.

08:24.780 --> 08:30.520
He owes those sharp reflexes of his to the karate he learned from before enrolling in elementary school.

08:30.520 --> 08:36.660
That move where he uses the goalpost is just a variation of the triangle kick from karate.

08:41.480 --> 08:43.230
Ken Wakashimazu...

08:43.230 --> 08:47.750
The only option I might have to defeat him may very well be my overhead kick.

08:50.580 --> 08:52.200
Tsubasa Ozora...

08:54.160 --> 08:54.920
Hyuga!

08:55.830 --> 08:57.680
I won't let you get in my way this time.

08:57.680 --> 08:58.680
I'll score!

08:59.840 --> 09:02.100
A diving catch from Wakabayashi!

09:02.100 --> 09:03.100
What?!

09:04.060 --> 09:09.990
That's right! Wakabayashi is a prodigy goalkeeper, capable of stopping each and every shot

09:09.990 --> 09:12.360
made from outside the penalty area.

09:13.390 --> 09:15.240
Did you see that, Hyuga?

09:15.240 --> 09:18.720
Even Tsubasa can't score against him
from outside of the penalty area.

09:18.720 --> 09:21.330
Of course it'd be impossible for you!

09:23.950 --> 09:26.710
"Even Tsubasa," he says...

09:27.790 --> 09:29.500
That's very interesting.

09:29.500 --> 09:33.670
That means that if I'm able to score
from outside of the penalty area,

09:33.670 --> 09:38.180
that will prove that I'm better than Tsubasa!

09:38.180 --> 09:41.460
We're 10 minutes into the first half, and the score is still 0-0

09:41.460 --> 09:44.800
thanks to the efforts of Wakashimazu and Wakabayashi.

09:44.800 --> 09:48.640
Which of these teams will be the first to score?

09:48.640 --> 09:54.530
These guys have all leveled up their individual skills since we first played against each other.

09:54.530 --> 09:57.780
However, we will win!

10:01.370 --> 10:04.390
It's only natural that their marking is focused on Tsubasa.

10:04.390 --> 10:05.830
That means I have a chance!

10:05.830 --> 10:10.580
All right! I, Teppei Kisugi, will try scoring for once!

10:10.580 --> 10:11.330
Tsubasa!

10:12.000 --> 10:14.550
The pass reaches Tsubasa, right in front of the goal!

10:14.550 --> 10:17.720
Damn it! Even though we're marking him so closely...

10:17.720 --> 10:18.720
All right!

10:18.720 --> 10:20.590
Will Tsubasa score this time?

10:20.590 --> 10:23.540
Or will Wakashimazu, the keeper, stop him again?

10:23.540 --> 10:24.600
Come on!

10:25.200 --> 10:29.020
It's no good. If I take this shot,
it won't get past Wakashimazu.

10:29.020 --> 10:30.020
Tsubasa!

10:30.020 --> 10:31.440
Kisugi?

10:33.250 --> 10:37.210
Even though he was in position to shoot,

10:37.210 --> 10:38.650
Tsubasa sends a pass in the opposite direction instead!

10:38.650 --> 10:39.570
What?!

10:39.570 --> 10:42.280
What a great show of judgment!

10:42.280 --> 10:44.450
Okay, I've got this!

10:44.450 --> 10:45.450
Crap!

10:45.450 --> 10:48.530
Nankatsu's ambush force, Kisugi shoots!

10:50.530 --> 10:51.280
What?!

10:51.280 --> 10:53.460
It won't go in!

10:53.460 --> 10:55.140
What's with those reflexes?!

10:55.140 --> 10:57.250
Wakashimazu parries this shot away, too!

10:57.250 --> 10:58.880
Nice, Wakashimazu!

10:58.880 --> 11:00.470
Even that wasn't enough?!

11:00.470 --> 11:03.470
That's it, it's time to use my overhead kick!

11:03.470 --> 11:06.970
This form... Tsubasa's setting up
for an overhead kick!

11:06.970 --> 11:09.980
Wakashimazu has yet to get up!

11:09.980 --> 11:12.400
As if I'd let you!

11:12.400 --> 11:15.940
The mid-air overheads clash!

11:23.300 --> 11:30.000
Hyuga managed to block Tsubasa's
overhead kick with one of his own!

11:30.000 --> 11:30.750
Captain!

11:30.750 --> 11:31.210
Tsubasa!

11:31.210 --> 11:33.750
I won't let this ball go to waste!

11:33.750 --> 11:35.250
I'll score!

11:35.250 --> 11:36.920
Come at me, then!

11:38.520 --> 11:40.170
The ball...

11:41.170 --> 11:42.920
Shoot...

11:44.070 --> 11:45.420
Shoot.

11:46.580 --> 11:47.460
I'll shoot it!

11:47.460 --> 11:47.890
What?!

11:48.640 --> 11:50.020
Tsubasa!

11:50.020 --> 11:50.890
What?!

11:54.050 --> 11:59.690
This has become a synchronized twin shot by Misaki and Tsubasa!

12:02.120 --> 12:03.580
What the...

12:03.580 --> 12:04.450
The ball...

12:12.090 --> 12:13.700
Goal!

12:13.700 --> 12:16.880
The goalkeeper, Wakashimazu, couldn't react to the shot!

12:16.880 --> 12:20.380
12 minutes into the first half,
Nankatsu finally scores the first goal.

12:20.380 --> 12:23.380
You did it! You scored the first goal!

12:23.380 --> 12:25.380
It's in...

12:25.380 --> 12:27.120
We did it, Tsubasa!

12:27.120 --> 12:29.030
We just scored the first goal!

12:29.030 --> 12:30.140
Huh, yeah.

12:30.140 --> 12:34.960
I hit my head when I fell, so I didn't see you coming to shoot.

12:34.960 --> 12:37.650
But we really did score, didn't we?

12:37.650 --> 12:40.160
You did it! Tsubasa! Misaki!

12:40.160 --> 12:41.140
Guys!

12:41.140 --> 12:43.440
That was an awesome shot!

12:43.440 --> 12:46.000
Since Tsubasa and Misaki both kicked the ball,

12:46.000 --> 12:47.690
the ball wobbled strangely,

12:47.690 --> 12:50.990
making it hard to keep track of
as it traveled forward so quickly.

12:50.990 --> 12:53.700
Even Wakashimazu was unable to stop it,

12:53.700 --> 12:57.750
despite putting up an iron defense thus far!

12:57.750 --> 13:00.730
That shot was awesome!

13:00.730 --> 13:02.710
As expected from Tsubasa and Misaki.

13:03.240 --> 13:05.450
I've been watching football for many years,

13:05.450 --> 13:08.220
but it's my first time seeing such a shot!

13:08.220 --> 13:12.010
You finally did it... Tsubasa, Misaki!

13:12.660 --> 13:16.270
Damn it! Why couldn't I react to that shot?

13:16.790 --> 13:17.980
Damn it all!

13:17.980 --> 13:19.730
Wakashimazu...

13:20.290 --> 13:21.440
It's all right.

13:21.440 --> 13:24.530
Forget about that one, Wakashimazu.

13:24.530 --> 13:28.070
They won't fire another shot like that.

13:28.070 --> 13:30.120
That was a fluke.

13:30.120 --> 13:31.160
Captain...

13:31.160 --> 13:35.700
I'll get back at them for that goal!

13:45.160 --> 13:47.600
In this scorching heat, what kind of offense

13:47.600 --> 13:52.850
will Meiwa FC show us, now that they're a goal behind?

13:52.850 --> 13:54.580
"If you take one, give one back!"

13:54.580 --> 13:56.390
That's the golden rule of battle.

13:56.390 --> 13:58.380
I am counting on you, Kojiro.

13:59.900 --> 14:03.940
I will protect this lead no matter what.

14:04.820 --> 14:06.570
I am coming for you, Nankatsu!

14:06.570 --> 14:08.840
Hyuga ferociously attacks!

14:08.840 --> 14:11.340
Did falling behind set his fighting spirit alight?

14:11.340 --> 14:12.830
What a competitive drive!

14:12.830 --> 14:14.360
We won't let you continue!

14:14.360 --> 14:16.500
Nankatsu doggedly rushes to defend!

14:17.380 --> 14:19.080
What a sharp sliding tackle!

14:22.550 --> 14:26.010
His prodigious power and sense see him through!

14:26.010 --> 14:28.170
Nankatsu can't stop him!

14:28.170 --> 14:30.100
All right! Go, Hyuga!

14:30.100 --> 14:31.930
We're counting on you to tie it!

14:31.930 --> 14:34.430
Kojiro's dribbling is as impressive as always.

14:34.430 --> 14:37.980
I often saw it when I played with him during my time at Meiwa.

14:37.980 --> 14:40.730
The minutes after you score are the most important.

14:40.730 --> 14:42.520
I will stop you no matter what, Kojiro!

14:43.850 --> 14:46.320
Misaki interrupts with a sliding tackle!

14:46.820 --> 14:50.800
Oh, but Sawada is here to recover the ball!

14:50.800 --> 14:51.530
Hyuga!

14:53.140 --> 14:54.700
Here's a big chance!

14:56.740 --> 14:59.580
Is he aiming for a long shot again?!

14:59.580 --> 15:00.800
I will score!

15:00.800 --> 15:04.360
I will score with a shot from outside the penalty area!

15:04.360 --> 15:05.540
Eat this!

15:05.540 --> 15:09.170
It's Hyuga's long distance bullet shot!

15:09.170 --> 15:12.590
The ball rockets towards the goal with a dreadful sound!

15:12.590 --> 15:13.680
Wakabayashi!

15:13.680 --> 15:15.470
Regardless of how many times you try...

15:15.470 --> 15:17.680
That just won't work on me!

15:18.420 --> 15:19.660
It's caught!

15:19.660 --> 15:21.740
It's a brilliant diving catch!

15:21.740 --> 15:24.860
Hyuga's third attempt ends without a goal!

15:25.860 --> 15:28.460
He might not be as flashy as Wakashimazu,

15:28.460 --> 15:31.110
but his defense is just as solid, nonetheless!

15:31.110 --> 15:34.120
That's Genzo Wakabayashi, Nankatsu's goalkeeper for you.

15:34.120 --> 15:35.690
That's right, Genzo.

15:35.690 --> 15:39.020
The most important thing for a goalkeeper is a

15:39.020 --> 15:40.750
solid, error-less play style.

15:40.750 --> 15:44.180
That's three times now that I wasn't able to score...

15:44.180 --> 15:45.210
Damn it all!

15:48.100 --> 15:51.170
Hyuga takes a shot from right outside the penalty area!

15:51.740 --> 15:54.720
But Wakabayashi dives and catches this, as well!

15:58.930 --> 16:01.020
Looking cool, Wakabayashi!

16:01.020 --> 16:05.040
If it were me up there, those incredible shots would likely be goals instead.

16:05.040 --> 16:06.190
Right, right.

16:06.190 --> 16:08.940
It looks like your leg is doing well, Wakabayashi.

16:09.830 --> 16:10.980
Damn it!

16:10.980 --> 16:11.690
Captain...

16:11.690 --> 16:15.040
Why are you so obsessed with
shooting from so far out?

16:15.780 --> 16:17.430
Did you just say, "on purpose"?

16:17.430 --> 16:18.330
Most likely.

16:18.330 --> 16:22.940
Wakabayashi has never conceded a goal from outside of the penalty area,

16:22.940 --> 16:25.240
a feat that is nothing short of legendary.

16:25.240 --> 16:31.180
Hyuga is desperate to prove his abilities
by crushing that legendary reputation.

16:31.180 --> 16:35.050
But that is a huge pitfall for a striker to fall into.

16:35.050 --> 16:41.790
To put it bluntly, right now, Hyuga is failing
the test to become Toho Academy's ace striker.

16:43.140 --> 16:44.730
Kojiro.

16:44.730 --> 16:48.480
Hooray! Hooray! Nankatsu!

16:44.730 --> 16:49.060
There's less than a minute left in this half!

16:48.920 --> 16:50.550
Score a goal, Hyuga!

16:49.060 --> 16:52.320
Meiwa eagerly attacks, as they want to score a goal

16:50.550 --> 16:51.730
Just one minute left!

16:52.320 --> 16:53.900
and end this half with a tie!

16:53.900 --> 16:54.650
Send it to me!

16:56.240 --> 16:57.030
Captain!

16:57.480 --> 17:00.280
Meiwa once again sends the ball forward to Hyuga!

17:00.280 --> 17:04.100
This time, I'll score!

17:04.100 --> 17:07.250
This last shot will also be from outside the penalty area!

17:08.750 --> 17:09.960
Eat this!

17:10.880 --> 17:12.170
It's a powerful shot!

17:12.170 --> 17:15.720
Will Wakabayashi be able to catch this as well?!

17:15.720 --> 17:19.260
Oh! Another player moves in as the shot is taken!

17:19.800 --> 17:21.660
It's Sawada!

17:21.660 --> 17:24.560
Wakabayashi is caught by surprise!

17:24.560 --> 17:25.270
Oh no!

17:26.060 --> 17:27.020
I did it!

17:27.020 --> 17:31.400
Has Meiwa tied the score before the end of the half?!

17:32.650 --> 17:34.570
Ah, Wakabayashi!

17:34.570 --> 17:40.270
He plants his hand on the ground and barely manages to kick the redirected ball away!

17:42.620 --> 17:43.840
Wakabayashi!

17:43.840 --> 17:46.210
The whistle blows! The first half is over!

17:46.210 --> 17:49.020
Wakabayashi has defended Nankatsu's goal well,

17:49.020 --> 17:51.040
allowing no goals in the first half!

17:51.040 --> 17:55.340
Despite conceding a goal, Wakashimazu has also performed brilliantly this half.

17:55.340 --> 17:59.120
It's safe to say that the first half was all about both of these goalkeepers.

18:00.340 --> 18:02.410
Good work, guys!

18:02.410 --> 18:03.470
Thanks!

18:03.470 --> 18:07.480
That shot by Tsubasa and Misaki was particularly incredible!

18:08.480 --> 18:13.610
It seems like they'll be recording it officially as an assist for Misaki, and a goal for Tsubasa.

18:13.610 --> 18:16.170
That means Tsubasa now has 28 goals!

18:16.170 --> 18:20.110
He's one goal ahead of Hyuga in the scoring competition!

18:20.110 --> 18:21.870
Don't you dare lose to likes of Hyuga!

18:22.420 --> 18:26.540
Frankly, I much prefer something else over the top scoring player title.

18:28.340 --> 18:29.890
The championship pennant!

18:29.890 --> 18:35.420
We have all worked hard for the sake of winning the championship pennant, haven't we?

18:35.420 --> 18:39.930
Let's win it no matter what, guys!

18:41.800 --> 18:43.550
Tsubasa...

18:43.550 --> 18:45.290
Of course, that goes without saying!

18:45.290 --> 18:47.550
I don't want to lose after making it this far!

18:47.550 --> 18:49.770
We owe Meiwa back after that first match.

18:50.340 --> 18:58.400
Tsubasa, you are an even greater captain than I was for Nankatsu SC, now.

18:58.400 --> 18:59.900
It was about to go in...

19:00.520 --> 19:02.760
It was so close.

19:02.760 --> 19:03.410
True.

19:03.870 --> 19:04.650
Takeshi.

19:04.650 --> 19:05.820
Yes!

19:05.820 --> 19:07.680
Don't do something like that again.

19:09.500 --> 19:11.220
Captain...?

19:13.150 --> 19:14.420
Hyuga...

19:14.420 --> 19:18.760
I'll be frank. The way you've played
today is not Meiwa's usual style.

19:18.760 --> 19:20.090
What did you say?

19:20.090 --> 19:23.740
Meiwa's is supposed to be a style
of football that wins at all costs.

19:23.740 --> 19:28.560
But today, Hyuga, all you've done is shoot over and over again from outside the penalty area!

19:28.560 --> 19:30.770
That is nothing like Meiwa's football!

19:33.380 --> 19:34.650
Hyuga!

19:35.220 --> 19:36.440
Takeshi...

19:37.310 --> 19:39.690
Y-yes?

19:40.830 --> 19:43.450
You are right.

19:45.480 --> 19:50.240
It seems my impatience is getting the better of me...

19:50.240 --> 19:54.680
Honestly, my admission to Toho Academy is at stake, here.

19:54.680 --> 19:55.900
What?!

19:55.900 --> 19:58.900
You mean that Toho Academy, the famous football academy?!

19:58.900 --> 19:59.340
That's it.

20:00.140 --> 20:03.430
They scouted me at the end of the first match.

20:03.430 --> 20:09.940
They told me they'd give me a full ride until college, with all of my education expenses paid.

20:09.940 --> 20:12.740
At home, we are struggling to make ends meet

20:12.740 --> 20:15.480
for our family of five, after my father's death.

20:16.220 --> 20:18.730
Frankly, I was thrilled.

20:19.400 --> 20:23.590
But the scout also mentioned they were looking at Tsubasa Ozora.

20:23.590 --> 20:27.240
In short, I think she will pick whoever wins this battle.

20:27.240 --> 20:30.980
That's why I kept shooting from outside of the penalty area,

20:30.980 --> 20:34.830
to prove once and for all that I am superior to Tsubasa.

20:34.830 --> 20:38.090
But that was a mistake.

20:38.090 --> 20:40.440
I was getting impatient.

20:40.440 --> 20:43.190
I finally realized that, once Takeshi told me.

20:43.190 --> 20:44.470
Hyuga...

20:47.120 --> 20:51.340
I will steal a goal from Wakabayashi
in this second half, no matter how!

20:51.340 --> 20:54.140
That's Meiwa's style, our winning football!

20:54.140 --> 20:56.520
We will turn this around,
and win for sure!

20:56.520 --> 20:57.650
Hyuga!

20:59.150 --> 21:00.450
Captain!

21:00.450 --> 21:01.330
You are right!

21:01.330 --> 21:02.760
Let's do it, Hyuga!

21:02.760 --> 21:05.580
We, Meiwa, will be the champions!

21:05.580 --> 21:09.660
Before they've realized it, these guys have become a strong, tightly-knit unit.

21:09.660 --> 21:14.040
As they rally around someone who has become their pillar of strength, Hyuga,

21:14.040 --> 21:16.920
all eleven members of this team have become as one.

21:16.920 --> 21:22.420
There is no reason why this team,
Meiwa FC, can't become champions.

21:23.140 --> 21:25.630
Isn't there, guys?

21:25.630 --> 21:26.680
Let's do this!

21:26.680 --> 21:30.680
Half-time is over, and the players
from both teams are again out on the field.

21:30.680 --> 21:33.270
Only these last 20 minutes remain.

21:36.340 --> 21:37.900
Just 20 more minutes left.

21:37.900 --> 21:41.900
If I win, I'll be going with you to Brazil, Roberto!

21:43.000 --> 21:45.000
Hurry up, mom!

21:45.000 --> 21:48.190
Kojiro's match has already begun!

21:48.190 --> 21:49.530
All right, all right!

21:49.530 --> 21:51.960
The second half begins!

21:51.960 --> 21:53.520
Nankatsu has a one-goal lead.

21:53.520 --> 21:57.290
Will they be able to keep it up and raise the purple championship pennant?

21:57.290 --> 22:01.940
Or will Meiwa turn the tables this second half,
and become the champions instead?

22:01.940 --> 22:03.900
Look, it's our brother!

22:06.320 --> 22:07.720
Kojiro...

22:09.470 --> 22:10.760
All right!

22:10.760 --> 22:14.770
Let's show them how Meiwa plays this game in the second half!

22:14.770 --> 22:15.390
Yeah!

22:38.870 --> 22:44.750
<i>chotto are mi na ace ga tooru</i>

22:38.870 --> 22:44.750
<i>Hey, look over there at the ace passing through</i>

22:44.750 --> 22:50.760
<i>suguremono zo to machijû sawagu</i>

22:44.750 --> 22:50.760
<i>He's the best, and the whole town cheers him on</i>

22:50.760 --> 22:56.770
<i>chô-chô samba, zigzag samba</i>

22:50.760 --> 22:56.770
<i>Butterfly samba, zig-zag samba</i>

22:56.770 --> 23:02.230
<i>aitsu no uwasa de chamba mo hashiru</i>

22:56.770 --> 23:02.230
<i>Even little old ladies go around talking about him</i>

23:03.190 --> 23:08.360
<i>sore ni tsukete mo ore-tacha nan na no</i>

23:03.190 --> 23:08.360
<i>So, even if we have him, who are we?</i>

23:09.280 --> 23:15.080
<i>ball hitotsu ni kiri-kiri mai sa</i>

23:09.280 --> 23:15.080
<i>The ball spins round and round</i>

23:15.080 --> 23:21.120
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:21.120 --> 23:26.130
<i>itsuka kimeru ze inazuma shoot</i>

23:21.120 --> 23:26.130
<i>One day, I'll score with a lightning shot!</i>

23:27.420 --> 23:33.300
<i>son toki ore ga super hero sa</i>

23:27.420 --> 23:33.300
<i>When that happens, I'll become a super hero!</i>

23:33.300 --> 23:39.180
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:39.180 --> 23:46.070
<i>moete seishun kakenukero</i>

23:39.180 --> 23:46.070
<i>This fierce youth is on the field!</i>

23:50.150 --> 24:00.770
COMING UP; EPISODE 24:
PERSEVERANCE, PURE PERSEVERANCE!
